<title>UK: BOE allots 1.25 bln stg in outright bills, repo.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 1.25 bln stg in outright bills, repo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 1.25 billion stg of assistance to help offset this morning's estimated money market shortage of 1.5 billion stg.</p>
<p>The bank bought 305 million stg in bills outright and 945 million stg in repos to April 18 and 21.</p>
<p>The repo rate was unchanged at 6.0 percent.</p>
</text>
